# Both Dockerfiles build from the repo root and need only the Rust crate, its toolchain and the Python metadata.
# Everything else (rust/target is tens of GB, .git, backlog, docs) stays out of the build context.
*
!rust-toolchain.toml
!pyproject.toml
!README.md
!rust/Cargo.toml
!rust/Cargo.lock
!rust/src
!rust/migrations
!rust/embed
